{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14101","headline":"苦哉行五首 三 · 戎昱","name":"苦哉行五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登楼望天衢，目极泪盈睫。\n强笑无笑容，须妆旧花靥。\n昔年买奴仆，奴仆来碎叶。\n岂意未死间，自爲匈奴妾。\n一生忽至此，万事痛苦业。\n得出塞垣飞，不如彼蜂蝶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}